  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Aiko Aiko**: back after 75 archived shows (1106 days); rare: 12 archived performances [9]\n- **Mickey**: rare: 9 archived performances [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dac2022-06-22.AKGmix.toaste.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 185 min; rated 3.5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: The reviewer describes the audio quality of the recording as sounding great [5]\n- **deadco2022-06-22.akg461-adktl-16bit**: source not stated; 18 songs; 184 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Beach balls were thrown during the performance, prompting the reviewer to download the file [3]\n- A beach ball hit the taping stand during the performance of this song [6]\n- The reviewer appreciates the specific spelling of the song title with an A [7]\n- Black Muddy River was played as part of the main set, not an encore [1]\n- A beach ball knocked down the taping stand during this song due to a torn muscle [2]\n- Jay Lane substituted for Billy, who sat out the second set due to injury [2]\n- The second set's energy surpassed that of the band's 2016 performance at the venue [8]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dac2022-06-22.AKGmix.toaste.flac16**: taped by Toaste; transferred by Toaste; source: 3x AKG398 shotguns (L,C,R); 1x AKG394 Figure-8 (L,R); 2x AKG391 cardioids ortf (L,R); 2x AKG392 omnis 2-foot spread (L,R) > Zoom F8 @ 44.1/16 [1]. Also: Recorded using multiple AKG microphones into a Zoom F8 at 44.1/16 resolution [1]\n- **deadco2022-06-22.akg461-adktl-16bit**: taped by jimmiec; transferred by jimmiec; source: AKG460 ck61 - ORTF, ADK TL hyper - PAS (Lawn, DFC) ~> DR-680 (24/48) [2]. Also: Captured via AKG460 and ADK TL hyper microphones into a DR-680 recorder [2]",
